# desc: 청구항 용어를 심사관이 문헌의 어떤 다른 용어에 대응시켰는가? (결손 terminology-mapping)
# suite: pa
# monotone: up
# expect-min: 1
PREFIX pa:   <https://w3id.org/sdkb/pa/>
PREFIX pakr: <https://w3id.org/sdkb/pa/kr/>
SELECT DISTINCT ?claimTerm ?documentTerm ?doc
WHERE {
  ?link a pa:EvidenceLink ; pa:claimTerm ?claimTerm ; pa:documentTerm ?documentTerm .
  OPTIONAL { ?link pa:inDocument ?doc }
  FILTER (STR(?claimTerm) != STR(?documentTerm))
}
ORDER BY ?claimTerm
